  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/PiramideAlimentosMercadoOnda-005.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La empresa de dietistas nutricionales Nuttralia ha proporcionadeo la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado informaci&oacute;n nutricional sobre la pir&aacute;mide de los alimentos a ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, que han&nbsp;realizado tambi&eacute;n una divertida gymkana para experimentar con los productos del Mercado Municipal de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-001.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-002.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-003.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-004.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-005.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-006.jpg\" alt=\"piramidealimentosmercadoonda-006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/piramidealimentsmercatonda/piramidealimentosmercadoonda-007.jpg